    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Simple 3D Platformer .Player is a Stick man .Every time Player jumps,stick man swarp Color.If Player Stepped on the Block that is the same Color as the Player,He get hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 20+ levels to Challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Player needs to Go to Exit Sign to Finish the level.and Collect some stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Grounds and walls are made of Color Blocks.Enemies also has it's own Color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Player should not Touch the same color Block.Otherwise he will be Knocked back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Every time player jumps,Player change Color.so Jump wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-WASD to move ,Space to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enjoy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Simple 3D Platformer .Player is a Stick man .Every time Player jumps,stick man swarp Color.If Player Stepped on the Block that is the same Color as the Player,He get hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 20+ levels to Challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Player needs to Go to Exit Sign to Finish the level.and Collect some stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Grounds and walls are made of Color Blocks.Enemies also has it's own Color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Player should not Touch the same color Block.Otherwise he will be Knocked back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Every time player jumps,Player change Color.so Jump wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-WASD to move ,Space to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enjoy!</p>",
    "short_description": "-A simple 3D platformer. Rule is simple: 1 You jump,you swarp Color.2 You touch the same Color Block.You get Hurt.",
